    + (garlic) <cook, add just before onion done, 1-2m>
{chili} = (onion) + (garlic) + (olive oil) + (tomato sauce choice) + (tomato choice) + (corn) + (beans choice) + (rice)
{chili} <heat, turn up to medium>
